{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Available Types"}], "prev": {"link": "../CopyTextButton/", "title": "CopyTextButton"}, "next": {"link": "../GameHighScore/", "title": "GameHighScore"}, "title": "ForceReply", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"forcereply\">\n<h1>ForceReply<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#forcereply\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.types.ForceReply\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.types.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">ForceReply</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.types.ForceReply\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Object used to force clients to show a reply interface.</p>\n<p>Upon receiving a message with this object, Telegram clients will display a reply interface to the user.</p>\n<p>This acts as if the user has selected the bot\u2019s message and tapped \u201cReply\u201d.\nThis can be extremely useful if you want to create user-friendly step-by-step interfaces without having to\nsacrifice privacy mode.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>selective</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">bool</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 Use this parameter if you want to force reply from specific users only. Targets:\n1) users that are &#64;mentioned in the text of the Message object;\n2) if the bot\u2019s message is a reply (has reply_to_message_id), sender of the original message.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>input_field_placeholder</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 The placeholder to be shown in the input field when the reply is active; 1-64 characters.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["api/types/GameHighScore", "GameHighScore", "N", "next"], ["api/types/CopyTextButton", "CopyTextButton", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">ForceReply</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#pyrogram.types.ForceReply\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ForceReply</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": true, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "api/types/ForceReply", "sidebars": ["sidebar/brand.html", "sidebar/search.html", "sidebar/scroll-start.html", "sidebar/navigation.html", "sidebar/scroll-end.html"], "alabaster_version": "1.0.0", "alabaster_version_info": [1, 0, 0], "furo_version": "2025.12.19", "furo_navigation_tree": "", "furo_hide_toc": false, "furo_pygments": {"light": {"background": "#eeffcc", "foreground": "black"}, "dark": {"background": "#202020", "foreground": "#d0d0d0"}}}